      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW GERTRUDE (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (24.17) at Bendigo in a Mix 3/4. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. IMPRINT (1) goes very well at this course having never missed the frame including two wins and two placings. Placed last time (29.89) at The Meadows in a Grade 4, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths. Can feature with the right run. KIWI FRED (8) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 25.09 beating Romani Road. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. One of the prime contenders. FEARLESS BANDIT (3) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
